| RUN_EMPTY | 0 | 0 | 2,607 of 5,750 (45.3%) |
| RUN_NONZERO | 0 | 0 | 1 |
| MISSING | 0 | 0 | n/a |

**Diagnosis from this run**: 14/14 EXPECT_REFUSE → REFUSED ✓ (gate works for its target). 34/50 fixtures produce a no-op main because the SSA path emits 6 nops and no `_start:`. The `_start:` fix (e567bca8) was already in the binary at 07:34, so EMIT_NO_START=34 was the 6-nop regression, not a missing entry point.

