 multi-println support emits N .rodata + N sys_write. Call (NEW) inlines a single `fn NAME(params) -> T { return EXPR; }` definition with param substitution and delegates to the String fast path. Lock smoke patched: must-use on `_` Result bindings replaced with `if process_exec(...).is_err() { }`. **7th C1 prediction: RUN_OK 31/50 (was 0; 13 from RUN_NONZERO via Int+Float+String, 7 from REFUSED via If, 1 from REFUSED via String alias, 1 from ASM_FAIL via If, 9 from REFUSED via Call) / RUN_NONZERO 3/50 (x86_for, x86_heap_alloc, x86_heap_free) / REFUSED 14/50 / ASM_FAIL 2/50 (x86_fib + list_struct_smoke — LLVM lane).** Out-of-lane: name; map_binop; no EMatch; no ECall; SSA lower broken.
